Scoped despill green/blue spill removal

The type, mix, expand, red, green, blue, brightness and alpha options (AVOption order, defaults and ranges), the packed
argb/rgba/abgr/bgra pixel-format list, the component offsets of config_output and the single-precision spill-map
arithmetic of do_despill_slice in src/video-ops/despill.ts follow libavfilter/vf_despill.c (despill_options,
do_despill_slice, filter_frame, config_output, pixel_fmts). The AV_OPT_TYPE_FLOAT range check and float storage and the
AV_OPT_TYPE_BOOL names follow libavutil/opt.c (write_number, set_string_bool).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
